--- An item of a list no item is ever put into has no kind, and a loop
--- over it has none to walk: refused before the program runs, in both
--- modes. The interpreter had run no rounds and gone on, and the compiled
--- program, holding the item as text, did not build (Rosetta Code,
--- Tropical algebra overloading)

e = []
for row in e
    for t in row
        log[t]
log['done']
